  "player_text": "Captain, I am standing in front of you. I asked you, not the crowd. Either name today's toll, or tell me you will not let me through.",
  "visible_motivation": "I had just been talking to the guard captain, but the reply said no one answered and told me to find that same captain. I press the person in front of me for a yes or no.",
